---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/tahmoor.css"
import "aos/dist/aos.css";
import waterImage from "../../public/servicesimages/tadmoor.png";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
import { getSEO } from "../utils/getSEO";
const seo = getSEO("irrigear-tahmoo");
---

<Layout title={seo.title} description={seo.description} keywords={seo.keywords}>

    <section>
<div class="inner-banner">
  <div class="inner-banner-content">
    <h1>Irrigear Tahmoor – Your Water Management Experts</h1>

  </div>
  </div>
</section>
  <!-- ============================= -->
  <!-- 1) PLUMBING SERVICES (Left Image) -->
  <!-- ============================= -->
<section class="services-section">

  <div class="section-wrapper plumbing-wrapper" id="irrigation-services">

    <!-- IMAGE -->
    <div class="plumbing-image-box">
      <div class="dots"></div>

<Image 
  src={waterImage} 
  alt="Water Generator" 
  class="section-img" 
  data-aos="fade-right"
/>
    </div>

    <!-- TEXT -->
    <div class="plumbing-content">
      <h2   class="section-title section-title reveal-letters">

Irrigear Tahmoor – Your<br>
Water Management Experts
</h2>
      <p   class="section-text" data-aos="fade-up">
    We deliver expert plumbing solutions, including system diagnostics, regular inspections, faucet and fixture 
    repairs, pipe maintenance, water quality testing, valve and pressure optimization, pump upgrades, and backflow 
    prevention. Our services also include water main construction, providing reliable installations and repairs 
    for sustainable water supply systems. Additionally, we offer compliance consulting and proactive strategies
     to ensure peak performance and long-term reliability.
      </p>
      
  </div>
    </div>

</section>
<div class="center-content">
  <h2 class="section-heading">Retail & Trade Supply – Everything You Need for Water Management</h2>

  <p class="section-subcontent">
    At Irrigear Tahmoor, we don’t just provide expert advice and services—we also offer a 
    comprehensive retail experience, supplying a vast range of high-quality products for homeowners, 
    farmers, businesses, and trade professionals.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="two-column-wrapper">
  
  <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
<div class="column-box">
  <h3 class="column-title">Our store stocks over 2.5 million water-related products, including:</h3>

  <ul class="column-list">
    <li>Pipes, fittings, and valves for irrigation, plumbing, and industrial applications.</li>
    <li>Pumps for household, pool, bore, commercial, and agricultural use, with in-store testing and repairs available.</li>
    <li>Filtration and water treatment systems to ensure safe, clean, and efficient water use.</li>
    <li>Water storage solutions, including tanks, troughs, and accessories.</li>
    <li>Hoses, sprinklers, and irrigation supplies for DIY installations or professional setups.</li>
    <li>Dust suppression and erosion control products to support construction and landscaping projects.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Whether you're looking for a small replacement part, a complete water system solution, or expert advice on the best products for your needs, our team is here to help.</p>
</div>

  <!-- DIVIDER -->
  <div class="vertical-divider"></div>

<div class="column-box">
  <h3 class="column-title">Our Expert Services Include</h3>

  <ul class="column-list">
    <li>Irrigation Solutions – Custom-designed systems for residential gardens, commercial landscapes, and agricultural applications.</li>
    <li>Dust Suppression – Effective dust control solutions for work sites and construction periods.</li>
    <li>Water Treatment and Testing – Water quality analysis and tailored filtration systems for residential and commercial use.</li>
    <li>Pump Services – Supply, installation, testing, and repairs for all types of pumps.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>At Irrigear Tahmoor, we pride ourselves on offering quality products, expert service, and tailored solutions to meet all your water management needs. Our commitment to ISO 9001 standards and Workplace Health & Safety best practices ensures that every solution we provide is reliable and built to last.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="center-content">
  <h2 class="section-heading">Visit Us Today</h2>

  <p class="section-subcontent">
    Whether you're a homeowner, farmer, contractor, or business owner, Irrigear Tahmoor has the knowledge, products, 
    and services to help you achieve efficient, sustainable, and cost-effective water management.
  </p>
<a href="#" class="ghl-btn-gradient">Visit Our Site</a>

</div>
</Layout>